<title>USA: Global Telecom sells $3 mln notes.</title>
<headline>Global Telecom sells $3 mln notes.</headline>
<dateline>ELMONT, N.Y. 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Global Telecommunication Solutions Inc said Tuesday it had consummated the sale of $3 million of notes in a private offering.</p>
<p>The notes are payable in two years without interest.</p>
<p>In consideration of the loan, the company issued warrants to buy three million shares of GTS common at $2.50 per share for five years.</p>
<p>The net proceeds, about $2.8 million, will be used for general corporate purposes, the company said.</p>
